{"id":"00147","root":"uni00147_1","name":{"ja":"秋山　凜子","en":"Akiyama Rinko"},"title":{"ja":"【クリスマス】","en":"【Christmas】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【クリスマス】 秋山　凜子","en":"【Christmas】 Akiyama Rinko"},"aliases":["Demon Rinko"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-12-14","limited":true,"characterId":1,"profile":{"ja":"ゆきかぜの先輩対魔忍。ゆきかぜの幼馴染で姉のような存在。忍の里に代々伝わる剣術『逸刀流』の皆伝。“斬鬼の対魔忍”と恐れられる手練の美しき剣客。妹（ゆきかぜ）と弟（達郎）の世話をやくのが趣味で二人にとことん優しく包容力があり甘いところが多々あるが、それは二人だけに見せる一面で、学園の評判では強く美しく厳しい先輩として見られている。恋愛より妹弟を愛でるのが楽しいためか、数多の男子の求愛にまったく興味を示さない。女子生徒の中ではレズ説が囁かれ、秘かに凜子様ファンクラブなるものが存在し強い広がりを見せているが本人は至ってノーマル。常にゆきかぜと行動をともにし、彼女を献身的にサポートしている。","en":"Akiyama Rinko, she/her: She is Mizuki Yukikaze's senior Taimanin and her childhood friend, almost like an older sister. A master of the sword art \"Itsutō-ryū,\" a technique passed down through generations in the ninja village, she is feared as the \"Demon-slashing Taimanin,\" a skilled and beautiful swordswoman. Her hobby is caring for her younger sister (Yukikaze) and younger brother (Akiyama Tatsuro), and she showers them with endless kindness and a surprisingly sweet side—though she only shows that side to them. At the academy she's regarded as a strong, beautiful, and strict senior. She shows no interest in the countless suitors pursuing her, preferring instead the joy of loving her siblings. Rumors of a lesbian relationship circulate among the female students, and a secret \"Lady Rinko fan club\" has quietly grown, though she herself remains perfectly normal. She constantly stays by Yukikaze's side, supporting her devotedly."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"北板利亜","forms":[{"id":"uni00147_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1230,2460],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[158,316],"def":[139,278],"spd":[66,66],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["1","70004"]},{"id":"uni00147_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1860,3720],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[241,482],"def